<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ko" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L21">I'm truly fine</text><text for="L20">Oh-oh-oh, I got this</text><text for="L23">Everything is hard because you're young</text><text for="L22">I think I know myself a little now</text><text for="L25">You're a child who always got scolded</text><text for="L24">Everything hurts because of the nagging</text><text for="L27">But the joy didn't last long, oh my</text><text for="L26">You just got past your early 20s</text><text for="L29">Jieun, let me tell you, this oppa just turned 30</text><text for="L28">They say it hurts because it's youth (aha)</text><text for="L30">I'm really not ready, but I've just became a grown-up</text><text for="L32">I'm only five years older than you</text><text for="L31">I still have a long way to go</text><text for="L34">You're not a grown-up nor a child, you're just you</text><text for="L33">Above 20, under 30, around that age, right there</text><text for="L36">Don't be afraid when the darkness falls around you</text><text for="L35">That's when you shine the brightest</text><text for="L38">Ever-beloved kid, that's you</text><text for="L37">You are so beautiful, you are fully bloomed</text><text for="L39">Palette, diaries and the times spent sleeping</text><text for="L41">I'm twenty five</text><text for="L40">I like it</text><text for="L43">Oh-oh-oh, I got this</text><text for="L42">I know you like me</text><text for="L45">I think I know myself a little now (I still have a lot to say)</text><text for="L44">I'm truly fine</text><text for="L47">I'm twenty five</text><text for="L46">I like it</text><text for="L49">Oh-oh-oh, I got this</text><text for="L48">I know you hate me</text><text for="L1">Like it, like it, like it</text><text for="L2">Got this, got this, got this</text><text for="L50">I've truly found</text><text for="L3">It's strange, but these days I just like things easy</text><text for="L4">But anyway, I still like Corinne's music</text><text for="L5">I prefer deep purple over hot pink, um</text><text for="L51">I think I know myself a little now</text><text for="L6">What else do I like? Pajamas with buttons, lipstick, and mischievous pranks</text><text for="L10">Oh-oh-oh, I got this</text><text for="L7">I like it</text><text for="L8">I'm twenty five</text><text for="L12">I think I know myself a little now</text><text for="L9">I know you like me</text><text for="L11">I'm truly fine</text><text for="L14">But anyway, I did look pretty l when I sang "Good Day"</text><text for="L13">I prefer bobbed hair over long hair</text><text for="L16">I like a colorful palette over a painting, diaries and the times spent sleeping</text><text for="L15">Oh, why is that? I like things that are a bit out of style</text><text for="L18">I'm twenty five</text><text for="L17">I like it</text><text for="L19">I know you hate me</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>IU</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata>
